{"title":"Knight's Extolment","gacha_type":3002,"content":"The W-Engine Channel <color=#FFFFFF>Knight's Extolment</color> is now available for a limited time only. Use Encrypted Master Tapes to Signal Search.<br/>\nDuring the event, Reception Rates for the limited S-Rank W-Engine <color=#FFB500>Knight's Extolment</color>, as well as A-Rank W-Engines <color=#E900FF>Kaboom the Cannon</color> and <color=#E900FF>Bashful Demon</color> are significantly boosted!<br/>\n※ The limited S-Rank W-Engine Signal above will not become available in the <color=#FFFFFF>Star-Studded Cast</color> Stable Channel.<br/>\n※ This Channel is a W-Engine Channel. The Search count for guaranteed Signals is cumulative across all W-Engine Channels but is independent of and unaffected by other types of Channels.<br/>\n※ This event Channel is open for a limited time only. All featured Signals may go live again in the future.<br/>\n※ Proxies can use the Custom Search function to customize the non-rate-up S-Rank W-Engines and boosted A-Rank W-Engines.<br/>\n<br/><color=#FFFFFF>〓 W-Engine Channel Signal Search 〓</color><br/>\n<color=#FFFFFF>[S-Rank Signals]</color><br/>\nIn the current W-Engine Channel, the base probability of an S-Rank W-Engine is <color=#FFFFFF>1.000%</color>. Within <color=#FFFFFF>80</color> Signal Searches, at least one S-Rank W-Engine is guaranteed. The overall probability of an S-Rank W-Engine (including the guarantee) is <color=#FFFFFF>2.000%</color>. The combined probability (including pity) for the current limited S-Rank W-Engine is <color=#FFFFFF>1.600%</color>.<br/>\nWhen an S-Rank W-Engine is obtained through this Signal Search, there is a <color=#FFFFFF>75.000%</color> probability that the S-Rank Signal obtained is the limited S-Rank W-Engine. If the S-Rank W-Engine obtained is not the current limited S-Rank W-Engine, then the next S-Rank W-Engine obtained is <color=#FFFFFF>guaranteed</color> to be the current limited S-Rank W-Engine <color=#FFB500>Knight's Extolment</color>.<br/>\n<color=#FFFFFF>[A-Rank Signals]</color><br/>\nIn the current W-Engine Channel, the base probability of an A-Rank Signal is <color=#FFFFFF>15.000%</color>, where the base probability for an A-Rank W-Engine Signal is <color=#FFFFFF>13.125%</color> and the base probability for an A-Rank Agent Signal is <color=#FFFFFF>1.875%</color>. Within <color=#FFFFFF>10</color> Signal Searches, at least one A-Rank or S-Rank Signal is guaranteed. The overall probability of A-Rank Signals (including the guarantee) is <color=#FFFFFF>18.000%</color>. <br/>\nWhen an A-Rank Signal is obtained through this Signal Search, there is a <color=#FFFFFF>75.000%</color> probability that the obtained A-Rank Signal will be one of the currently boosted A-Rank W-Engines. If the A-Rank Signal obtained is not one of the boosted W-Engines, then the next A-Rank Signal you obtain is <color=#FFFFFF>guaranteed</color> to be one of the currently boosted W-Engines. When a currently boosted A-Rank W-Engine is obtained through this Signal Search, there is an equal probability of obtaining each individual boosted A-Rank W-Engine <color=#E900FF>Kaboom the Cannon</color> and <color=#E900FF>Bashful Demon</color>.<br/><br/><color=#FFFFFF>〓 Special Notes 〓</color><br/>\nResidual Signals and Fading Signals can be obtained when Signal Searching in the current Channel. You can exchange Residual Signals and Fading Signals for items in the Signal Shop. See below for details:<br/>\n<color=#FFFFFF>[Obtaining an S-Rank Signal]</color><br/>\n• Each S-Rank W-Engine obtained in the current Channel will also grant Residual Signal ×40.<br/>\n<color=#FFFFFF>[Obtaining an A-Rank Signal]</color><br/>\n• The 2nd to 7th copies of an A-Rank Agent will be converted into Agent Focus ×1 and Residual Signal ×8. From the 8th copy onwards, Agents will be converted into Residual Signal ×20.<br/>\n• Each A-Rank W-Engine obtained in the current Channel will also grant Residual Signal ×8.<br/>\n<color=#FFFFFF>[Obtaining a B-Rank Signal]</color><br/>\n• Each B-Rank W-Engine obtained in the current Channel will also grant Fading Signal ×20.<br/>","items_up_star_5":[{"item_id":0,"origin_item_id":14159,"item_name":"Knight's Extolment","item_type":"5","star":5,"is_up":0,"image_url":"https://operation-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/gacha_info/nap/26eef5a02ea9d9b6e561b03c32f01824_7275368488408687296.png","item_attr":"","item_base_type":""}],"items_up_star_4":[{"item_id":-1,"origin_item_id":13115,"item_name":"Kaboom the Cannon","item_type":"5","star":4,"is_up":0,"image_url":"https://operation-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/gacha_info/nap/6f73b80ff19ae67d51e25f03f1d5034a_6097276620086127142.png","item_attr":"","item_base_type":""},{"item_id":-2,"origin_item_id":13113,"item_name":"Bashful Demon","item_type":"5","star":4,"is_up":0,"image_url":"https://operation-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/gacha_info/nap/baf28a67b12b7ee4ff713bb570e93060_4660931299475424897.png","item_attr":"","item_base_type":""}],"items_avatar_star_5":null,"items_avatar_star_4":[{"item_id":-18,"origin_item_id":1011,"item_name":"Anby","item_type":"","star":4,"is_up":0,"image_url":"","item_attr":"","item_base_type":""},{"item_id":-19,"origin_item_id":1031,"item_name":"Nicole","item_type":"","star":4,"is_up":0,"image_url":"","item_attr":"","item_base_type":""},{"item_id":-20,"origin_item_id":1061,"item_name":"Corin","item_type":"","star":4,"is_up":0,"image_url":"","item_attr":"","item_base_type":""},{"item_id":-21,"origin_item_id":1081,"item_name":"Billy","item_type":"","star":4,"is_up":0,"image_url":"","item_attr":"","item_base_type":""},{"item_id":-22,"origin_item_id":1111,"item_name":"Anton","item_type":"","star":4,"is_up":0,"image_url":"","item_attr":"","item_base_type":""},{"item_id":-23,"origin_item_id":1121,"item_name":"Ben","item_type":"","star":4,"is_up":0,"image_url":"","item_attr":"","item_base_type":""},{"item_id":-24,"origin_item_id":1131,"item_name":"Soukaku","item_type":"","star":4,"is_up":0,"image_url":"","item_attr":"","item_base_type":""},{"i